{"about":["✦ \"A tense and terrifying survival horror adventure where you'll dread the lights going out.\" - Alpha Beta Gamer","FEATURES: ▪ Find the Truth Or Die In Shame and Terror - enjoy a hardcore survival horror experience. ▪ Face The Boy - overcome an unpredictable foe that can appear anywhere at any time. ▪ Pay Attention - use the technology to your advantage and avoid confrontation. ▪ Watch The Lights - …or prepare to fight. ▪ Master the Mechanics - hone your skill in a game that does not hold your hand.","No Son Of Mine is a survival horror game focused on combat, stealth, exploration, puzzle solving, and uncovering a gruesome mystery. Can you face the unpredictable, deadly, and cruel foe and find the truth before HE finds you?"],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/2213/1f7d1729f5cb80bd651617650a205bc9462db81d8afad2b0.jpeg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/2213/1f7d1729f5cb80bd651617650a205bc9462db81d8afad2b0.jpeg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/2213/6442a97753a81839b1b72e917b193fee2609c9634d5385d4.jpeg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/2213/6442a97753a81839b1b72e917b193fee2609c9634d5385d4.jpeg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/2213/fb41694ead86d31f57ec873e4530aec4a9b4c1584f0fcdca.jpeg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/2213/fb41694ead86d31f57ec873e4530aec4a9b4c1584f0fcdca.jpeg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/2213/e9cbc2eb256efd476b2be86ea1183d5395337401faaf67cd.jpeg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/2213/e9cbc2eb256efd476b2be86ea1183d5395337401faaf67cd.jpeg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/2213/8a150cb9bf8fb675bfea788aa8eb1b2285